    <string name="privacy_policy_text">DailyHisaab is a fully offline personal finance application developed by Abhay Sachin Donde. \n\nAll your financial data, expenses, and budgets are stored locally on your device using an SQLite database. We do not collect, transmit, or share any personal or financial information with external servers, cloud providers, or third parties. \n\nThe app requires no internet permission and does not use third-party analytics or tracking SDKs. Your privacy is absolutely guaranteed by the offline nature of the application.</string>
    <string name="terms_conditions_text">By using DailyHisaab, you agree to these terms.\n\nDailyHisaab is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. While we strive for accurate financial calculations, the developer (Abhay Sachin Donde) is not liable for any financial losses, data corruption, or inaccuracies resulting from the use of this app.\n\nIt is your responsibility to regularly export and back up your data locally. The app is intended for personal use only.</string>
